(7567401, 1214042, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great toy-like effect. My top pick.</td>', 'Great toy-like effect. My top pick.', '2018-05-01 00:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567435, 1214086, 60581, '<td valign="top">I see this getting on top! Well done!</td>', 'I see this getting on top! Well done!', '2018-05-01 09:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567436, 1213865, 60581, '<td valign="top">In my top 3!</td>', 'In my top 3!', '2018-05-01 09:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567456, 1214070, 61396, '<td valign="top">that''s tilt alright!</td>', 'that''s tilt alright!', '2018-05-01 13:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567468, 1213778, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m really not a fan of this effect but you use it in an interesting way here. I like this photo. It''s the best in the challenge, for me.</td>', 'I''m really not a fan of this effect but you use it in an interesting way here. I like this photo. It''s the best in the challenge, for me.', '2018-05-01 14:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567470, 1214186, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  It would still be fine without the tilt-shift effect, but here the spoonbill (I think) just landing is imbued with dignity, wonder and intimacy.  The width of the tilt-shift is perfect.  The back wing blurs into the shoreline, or raft of water vegetation, as do the feet just disengaging from the silky cloud of reflection.  The sharp zone also features the clumps of  vegetation and the anchor of the farthest left vegetation.  The bird''s mate and chick move dreamily just out of reach.  The disposition of light and dark is interesting and harmonious.  The background strip has the feel of looking edgewise into a galaxy.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful image.  It would still be fine without the tilt-shift effect, but here the spoonbill (I think) just landing is imbued with dignity, wonder and intimacy.  The width of the tilt-shift is perfect.  The back wing blurs into the shoreline, or raft of water vegetation, as do the feet just disengaging from the silky cloud of reflection.  The sharp zone also features the clumps of  vegetation and the anchor of the farthest left vegetation.  The bird''s mate and chick move dreamily just out of reach.  The disposition of light and dark is interesting and harmonious.  The background strip has the feel of looking edgewise into a galaxy.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2018-05-01 14:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567472, 1214161, 173844, '<td valign="top">Not despite the modest subject of focus, but because of it, I find this image endearing.  Also, because it embraces the typical miniaturization of model railroading.  And then the subtle interplay of the variety of lines can also be appreciated.  I find gazing into this picture to be calming.<br/>Second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Not despite the modest subject of focus, but because of it, I find this image endearing.  Also, because it embraces the typical miniaturization of model railroading.  And then the subtle interplay of the variety of lines can also be appreciated.  I find gazing into this picture to be calming.Second favorite of the challenge.', '2018-05-01 15:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567474, 1213915, 173844, '<td valign="top">The tilt-shift picks out a neighborhood amid the immense urban sprawl, so the viewer can draw a breath for some moments.  I less notice the buildings than the pinpricks of light, a binary code eruption.  And the sunbursts, which generally leave me unmoved, here in miniature are very pleasing.  It''s wonderful how you''ve tamed the bustling immensity.</td>', 'The tilt-shift picks out a neighborhood amid the immense urban sprawl, so the viewer can draw a breath for some moments.  I less notice the buildings than the pinpricks of light, a binary code eruption.  And the sunbursts, which generally leave me unmoved, here in miniature are very pleasing.  It''s wonderful how you''ve tamed the bustling immensity.', '2018-05-01 15:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567477, 1213938, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image is the most convincing miniaturization of the challenge.  I could swear the vehicles are plastic and the fields flocked greenery.  An apt choice of subject.  How''d you get the river to actually look like water?</td>', 'This image is the most convincing miniaturization of the challenge.  I could swear the vehicles are plastic and the fields flocked greenery.  An apt choice of subject.  How''d you get the river to actually look like water?', '2018-05-01 15:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567480, 1214086, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject, that chain of tennis courts.  I feel compelled to see them as postage stamps, or the old green stamps given out at supermarkets to be glued into books to be later redeemed for toasters and stemware.  Also has the feel of looking out an airplane window on final approach.</td>', 'Good choice of subject, that chain of tennis courts.  I feel compelled to see them as postage stamps, or the old green stamps given out at supermarkets to be glued into books to be later redeemed for toasters and stemware.  Also has the feel of looking out an airplane window on final approach.', '2018-05-01 15:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567481, 1213865, 173844, '<td valign="top">However anachronistic, this feels like a diorama depicting a scene from Dickens.  A fine decision to highlight a strip of buildings on the riverfront.  Another illusion, at least for me, is that this comes across as sepia, in keeping with the 19th century atmosphere.  Maybe this is just a foreigner''s gloss.  I especially like how the people emerge on the farther end of the bridge in an act of literary resuscitation.</td>', 'However anachronistic, this feels like a diorama depicting a scene from Dickens.  A fine decision to highlight a strip of buildings on the riverfront.  Another illusion, at least for me, is that this comes across as sepia, in keeping with the 19th century atmosphere.  Maybe this is just a foreigner''s gloss.  I especially like how the people emerge on the farther end of the bridge in an act of literary resuscitation.', '2018-05-01 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567482, 1214082, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great title for this image.  It''s as if you''ve pried the back off an old radio, and as you peer closer and closer an entire hitherto unknown world comes into focus.  Precise and cinematic.</td>', 'Great title for this image.  It''s as if you''ve pried the back off an old radio, and as you peer closer and closer an entire hitherto unknown world comes into focus.  Precise and cinematic.', '2018-05-01 15:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567483, 1214163, 173844, '<td valign="top">An appealing scene that I just wish had a narrower strip of focus.  The cars look too real.  Or maybe greater distance would do it.  Just saying, because what do I know, not having entered the challenge because of lack of knowledge.  The details of the potted plants, mailboxes and the Roxy draw one in.  The reds make a nice splash.</td>', 'An appealing scene that I just wish had a narrower strip of focus.  The cars look too real.  Or maybe greater distance would do it.  Just saying, because what do I know, not having entered the challenge because of lack of knowledge.  The details of the potted plants, mailboxes and the Roxy draw one in.  The reds make a nice splash.', '2018-05-01 15:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567484, 1214172, 173844, '<td valign="top">A completely different direction in choice of subject, and successfully attained.  The highlighted rim, encrusted in fungi, issues that spooky invitation, the interior being nicely blurred.  The title is great.  Brings the mind to a concentration of mingled curiosity and dread.</td>', 'A completely different direction in choice of subject, and successfully attained.  The highlighted rim, encrusted in fungi, issues that spooky invitation, the interior being nicely blurred.  The title is great.  Brings the mind to a concentration of mingled curiosity and dread.', '2018-05-01 15:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567485, 1214080, 173844, '<td valign="top">The players on the field and the spectators are nicely miniaturized, figurines painted with brushes of only several bristles.  The vehicles don''t fare as well.  Still, the sense of place and time of day are compelling.</td>', 'The players on the field and the spectators are nicely miniaturized, figurines painted with brushes of only several bristles.  The vehicles don''t fare as well.  Still, the sense of place and time of day are compelling.', '2018-05-01 15:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567490, 1214186, 61396, '<td valign="top">great and tilted too</td>', 'great and tilted too', '2018-05-01 18:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
