(7567877, 1214174, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>Very effective use of the tilt/shift technique Janine. I like the use of mono it contrasts the dark centre against the petal very effectively. Your composition is good, the soft focus areas really make the centre stand out. I like the whites but feel a touch less exposure may have benefited but all in all a very nice job, well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well Very effective use of the tilt/shift technique Janine. I like the use of mono it contrasts the dark centre against the petal very effectively. Your composition is good, the soft focus areas really make the centre stand out. I like the whites but feel a touch less exposure may have benefited but all in all a very nice job, well done.', '2018-05-07 06:20:16.000000', NULL, 0),
